# Glass and metal balls on a plane (docs/apps/raytrace.md, "Example scenes"), under a light and a
# sky that gives light. Glass's shadow is light of its colour, not a caustic: the tracer finds
# no light by way of glass or a mirror after a matt surface.
camera target 0 0.3 0.2 turn 20 tilt 22 far 3.3 lens 0.6
background colour 0.6 0.75 1 power 0.35
object Ground plane scale 5 colour 0.75 0.75 0.72
object "Clear glass" ball kind glass density 0 colour 1 1 1 scale 0.8 place -0.95 0.4 0.1
object "Green glass" ball kind glass density 1.5 colour 0.35 0.9 0.5 scale 0.8 place 0 0.4 0.75
object Gold ball kind metal rough 0.2 colour 1 0.78 0.34 scale 0.8 place 0 0.4 -0.6
object Mirror ball kind mirror colour 0.95 0.95 0.95 scale 0.8 place 0.95 0.4 0.1
object Copper ball kind metal rough 0.45 colour 0.95 0.55 0.4 scale 0.5 place -0.7 0.25 1.1
object "Red plastic" ball kind plastic colour 0.8 0.08 0.06 scale 0.5 place 0.8 0.25 1.0
light Sun place -2.5 5 1.5 radius 0.3 power 120
